# Line endings are not a preference here — they are correctness.
#
# 23 of 68 shell scripts were checked out with CRLF on a Windows working
# copy, and every one of them fails inside a Linux container on
# `set -euo pipefail\r: invalid option name`. It went unnoticed for a
# whole stage because the suites were being run as `python3 ci/x.py`
# directly; the `.sh` wrappers and therefore `./run.sh` itself had never
# been exercised.
#
# Everything the containers execute is LF, whatever the checkout host is.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
*.tar binary
*.pyc binary
